-- The help Service: `help`, as a Script. mua sends `help target, actor`,
-- with Nothing for the target, and `ask mua to verbs` gives the World's
-- Verbs and Aliases.

use join from text

on help target, actor
  ask mua to verbs
  put it into words
  return join([
    `Commands: ${join(the names of words, ", ")}.`,
    `Move by naming a direction: north, south, east, west, up, down and so on (or ${join(the aliases of words, ", ")}).`,
    "Say something with say, or start with a quote: 'hello.",
    "Repeat the last command with again (g)."
  ], `\n`)
end help
